                                "sense_id": "722856c5-7f97-36c7-9b2e-bdadd25d5d3b",
                                "text": "[M]any species having eschariform zoaria in quiet water are able to assume the membraniporiform habitus in strongly agitated water."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "373fe118-3d8b-34e1-8a26-365c3d57fefc",
